# Same line endings for everyone (Windows / WSL / macOS / Linux)
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary

# Line lists that every branch appends to: on merge, keep BOTH sides' lines instead of conflicting.
# Applies to local merges and rebases (run `git merge origin/main` before the PR, see CONTRIBUTING.md).
# Afterwards `make index` flags any duplicate INDEX entries.
INDEX.md          merge=union
wiki/decisions.md merge=union
wiki/glossary.md  merge=union
wiki/data.md      merge=union
wiki/team.md      merge=union

# The lockfile is never text-merged. On conflict: resolve pyproject.toml, then `uv lock`, then `git add uv.lock`.
uv.lock -merge linguist-generated=true
